{"我不想争斗"}
[00:23.06]Can you see the flicker lights, baby?
{"宝贝，你能看见那闪烁的灯光吗？"}
[00:26.68]Put your glass up in the air with me
{"和我一起把酒杯举向空中"}
[00:30.38]Hollar hollar, let them hear us loudly
{"大声呼喊，让他们清楚地听见我们"}
[00:34.02]Our top is off, let's show them off proudly
{"我们敞开心扉，自豪地展示自己"}
[00:37.83]Wicked, wicked Wonderland
